data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Split every residual on the test |r| ≤ δ. Inside the threshold the loss is ½r² and its derivative is r.\nOutside it the loss is δ(|r| − δ/2) and its derivative is δ·sign(r). The two pieces agree at |r| = δ.\nAverage the losses over n, and divide each derivative by n. Validate the inputs before computing."},"hints_note":null}

